1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:02,944
Hey everyone, welcome to Car Service
Podcast.

2
00:00:03,294 --> 00:00:06,390
I'm Sam, and today we're talking
differential repair.

3
00:00:06,740 --> 00:00:10,556
Our guest is Chidi, a Nigerian
entrepreneur who needed a second opinion.

4
00:00:10,906 --> 00:00:13,954
Hi! Thanks for having me.

5
00:00:14,303 --> 00:00:16,775
Chidi, what brought you to Golden Horse?

6
00:00:17,125 --> 00:00:21,349
Another garage said my diff was shot, but
the quote felt high.

7
00:00:21,699 --> 00:00:22,923
So you booked online?

8
00:00:23,273 --> 00:00:27,689
Yep, golden‑horse.ae, picked a slot for 10
am.

9
00:00:28,039 --> 00:00:30,007
How was the workshop when you arrived?

10
00:00:30,357 --> 00:00:36,405
Clean, organized, Al Quoz 3, 22nd Street,
Warehouse 4.

11
00:00:36,755 --> 00:00:37,835
Professional vibe?

12
00:00:38,185 --> 00:00:41,737
Absolutely, the team greeted me right
away.

13
00:00:42,086 --> 00:00:43,286
What did they find?

14
00:00:43,636 --> 00:00:48,172
They inspected, said the bearings were
worn, not the whole unit.

15
00:00:48,522 --> 00:00:49,434
That's a relief.

16
00:00:49,784 --> 00:00:56,024
They explained the repair, quoted 350 AED,
no hidden fees.

17
00:00:56,374 --> 00:00:57,694
How long did it take?

18
00:00:58,044 --> 00:01:01,164
A few hours, I waited in the lounge.

19
00:01:01,514 --> 00:01:02,498
And the car now?

20
00:01:02,848 --> 00:01:07,072
Smooth, no whine, feels solid on the
highway.

21
00:01:07,421 --> 00:01:08,525
Communication?

22
00:01:08,875 --> 00:01:13,483
Clear, they showed me the old parts,
answered every question.

23
00:01:13,833 --> 00:01:14,409
Worth it?

24
00:01:14,759 --> 00:01:18,671
Definitely, saved me a lot compared to the
first quote.

25
00:01:19,021 --> 00:01:20,965
Great story, thanks Chidi.

26
00:01:21,315 --> 00:01:23,259
Now, Omar with a quick tip.

27
00:01:23,609 --> 00:01:27,977
Sure. Dubai roads and speed bumps stress
suspension components.

28
00:01:28,327 --> 00:01:30,871
Regular checks catch worn bushings early.

29
00:01:31,220 --> 00:01:32,060
Good reminder.

30
00:01:32,410 --> 00:01:35,074
Warning sign of the week: a clunk when you
turn.

31
00:01:35,424 --> 00:01:38,112
That often means differential or CV joint
wear.

32
00:01:38,462 --> 00:01:40,742
Don't ignore it, get it inspected.

33
00:01:41,092 --> 00:01:42,004
Thanks for listening.

34
00:01:42,354 --> 00:01:45,042
Book your next service at golden‑horse.ae.

35
00:01:45,392 --> 00:01:46,424
See you next time!
